{"id":4103,"title":{"romaji":"Seija Musou: Salaryman, Isekai de Ikinokoru Tame ni Ayumu Michi","english":"The Great Cleric","native":"聖者無双 ～サラリーマン、異世界で生き残るために歩む道～"},"slug":"seija_musou_salaryman_isekai_de_ikinokoru_tame_ni_ayumu_michi","synopsis":"Can a former salaryman become peerless in another world?! \n\r\n\n\r\nA salaryman was shot to death just before earning a promotion, and a god decided to reincarnate him in another world as a fifteen-year-old healer named Luciel. On top of all that, the country he was born into seems to hate healers. Feeling that he's in danger, Luciel visits the adventurers' guild in hopes of keeping himself safe. But the training is much harder than he expected, and every day he's forced to drink a mysterious beverage called \"Substance X.\" Wait, this life doesn't seem to have anything to do with being a healer... \n\r\n\n\r\nThe day-to-day life of a super-masochistic, back-from-the-dead healer begins, with his very survival on the line! \n\r\n\n\r\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2023,"createdAt":"2023-07-08 02:37:10","updatedAt":"2024-03-22 21:20:37","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":53263},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":46600},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":155418},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":17662},{"site":"ANN","externalId":26414},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":21988},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":11259,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/xyHPKnfZNpPtdEkU6zl3BxWxebLJXpYA3rpjFKKp.jpg"},{"id":11260,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/B6r9Z6g8lSuYwuIu5EOTg6YwlXgXf2UKXH4KRdli.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":251,"name":"Yokohama Animation Lab","slug":"yokohama_animation_lab"},{"id":384,"name":"Cloud Hearts","slug":"cloud_hearts"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":12378,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":12343,"title":{"rom